OL,12,G0306FOutlook
OL,13,     GTobias Mupfuti was a homeless
OL,14,     Gchild in Zimbabwe when he taught
OL,15,     Ghimself to box. Training alone in
OL,16,     Gthe bush, he gathered a following
OL,17,     Gof other kids who he started to
OL,18,     Gcoach.
